                                    "speaker": "???",
                                    "text": "#Um... take care on your way, {NICKNAME}."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6634402",
            "initDialog": "663440201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "663440201",
                    "speaker": "???",
                    "text": "#It's you, {NICKNAME}! Hehe, long time no see! How have you been?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "663440202",
                            "text": "Has something good happened?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "663440203",
                                    "speaker": "???",
                                    "text": "Hehe, just between us — I discovered that the hot spring's water temperature is back to normal, which is great news for me — now my little Koholasaurs can play freely, and I won't have to worry anymore!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "663440204",
                                    "speaker": "???",
                                    "text": "Next up, time to go have some fun! I'll enjoy the hot springs and the volcano to the fullest!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "663440205",
                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                    "text": "Enjoy yourself!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "663440206",
                                    "speaker": "???",
                                    "text": "#Thanks, {NICKNAME}! You make sure to enjoy yourself too, alright?"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
